# AcmeOutfitters

Data dictionary of the semantic model **Model** (culture en-US, compatibility level 1601).

Acme Outfitters: a synthetic outdoor-gear retailer (fictional data, DashCraft example).

## Summary

| Object | Count |
|---|---:|
| Tables | 11 |
| Columns | 81 |
| Calculated columns | 11 |
| Calculated tables | 2 |
| Measures | 33 |
| Relationships | 8 |
| Parameters | 1 |
| Shared expressions | 2 |
| Roles | 2 |

## Relationships

| From → To | Cardinality | Cross-filter | Active |
|---|---|---|---|
| Orders[Customer ID] → Customers[Customer ID] | many-to-one | both directions | yes |
| Orders[Product ID] → Products[Product ID] | many-to-one | single | yes |
| Orders[Store ID] → Stores[Store ID] | many-to-one | single | yes |
| Orders[Order Date] → Date[Date] | many-to-one | single | yes |
| Orders[Ship Date] → Date[Date] | many-to-one | single | no |
| Returns[Order ID] → Orders[Order ID] | one-to-one | both directions | yes |
| Targets[Region] → Stores[Region] | many-to-many | single | yes |
| Targets[Month] → Date[Date] | many-to-one | single | yes |

## Tables

| Table | Kind | Columns | Measures | Description |
|---|---|---:|---:|---|
| Orders | table | 15 | 20 | One row per order line (synthetic). Cleaned in M: rows without an id and duplicates removed, keys trimmed and upper-cased, blank discounts set to 0. |
| Customers | table | 14 | 1 | Customers (synthetic). Account managers are parsed from Python-style lists by fnParseNames. |
| Products | table | 9 | 0 | Product catalog: Category \> Subcategory \> Product. |
| Stores | table | 12 | 0 | Stores and online channels. Manager Email drives the dynamic security role. |
| Targets | table | 3 | 3 | Monthly sales targets per region (many-to-many with Stores on Region). |
| Returns | table | 6 | 3 | Returned orders: at most one return per order (one-to-one with Orders). |
| Web Sessions | table | 7 | 5 | Website and app sessions. No relationship to any other table: filters on it never reach the sales tables. |
| Date | calculated table | 8 | 0 | Calendar 2024-2025, marked as the date table. |
| Time Calc | calculation group | 2 | 0 | Calculation group applied to any measure: Current, YTD, PY and YoY %. |
| Products Never Sold | calculated table | 4 | 1 | Calculated table: catalog products without any order. |
| Last Refreshed | table (hidden) | 1 | 0 | Single row stamped with the refresh time (UTC). Not used by any expected value. |

### Orders

One row per order line (synthetic). Cleaned in M: rows without an id and duplicates removed, keys trimmed and upper-cased, blank discounts set to 0.

Kind: table.

#### Columns

| Name | Type | Description | Source |
|---|---|---|---|
| Order ID (key) | string | Order number (SO-…). Unique after Table.Distinct. | Order ID |
| Order Date | dateTime, format yyyy-mm-dd |  | Order Date |
| Ship Date | dateTime, format yyyy-mm-dd | Blank for cancelled and pending orders. Inactive relationship to 'Date' (USERELATIONSHIP). | Ship Date |
| Customer ID (hidden) | string |  | Customer ID |
| Store ID (hidden) | string |  | Store ID |
| Product ID (hidden) | string |  | Product ID |
| Quantity | int64, format 0 |  | Quantity |
| Unit Price | double, format \\$#,0.00 |  | Unit Price |
| Discount | double, format 0% |  | Discount |
| Status | string | Completed, Cancelled or Pending. | Status |
| Line Amount | double, format \\$#,0.00 | Quantity × unit price × (1 − discount), computed in M. | Line Amount |
| Line Cost | double, format \\$#,0.00 | Blank when the product is not in the catalog. | calculated (DAX) |
| Order Size | string |  | calculated (DAX) |
| Is Returned | string | Context transition through the one-to-one relationship to Returns. | calculated (DAX) |
| Days To Ship | int64, format 0 |  | calculated (DAX) |

#### Measures

| Measure | Format | Folder | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| Total Sales | `\$#,0.00` | Sales | Sum of the order line amounts. |
| Total Cost | `\$#,0.00` | Sales |  |
| Gross Margin | `\$#,0.00` | Sales |  |
| Margin % | `0.0%` | Sales |  |
| Sales (Scaled) | `\$#,0.00` | Sales | Total Sales with a dynamic format string: $1.23M, $45.6K or $789.00. |
| Completed Sales | `\$#,0.00` | Sales |  |
| Shipped Sales | `\$#,0.00` | Sales | Sales by ship date (inactive relationship). |
| Sales All Stores (hidden) | `\$#,0.00` | Sales |  |
| Store Share | `0.0%` | Sales |  |
| Order Count | `#,0` | Orders |  |
| Units Sold | `#,0` | Orders |  |
| Active Customers | `#,0` | Orders | Distinct customer ids on orders, unknown ids included. |
| Avg Order Value | `\$#,0.00` | Orders |  |
| Revenue per Unit | `\$#,0.00` | Orders |  |
| Last Order Date | `yyyy-mm-dd` | Orders |  |
| Unknown Product Orders | `0` | Data Quality | Orders whose product id is not in the catalog. |
| Sales YTD | `\$#,0.00` | Time Intelligence |  |
| Sales PY | `\$#,0.00` | Time Intelligence |  |
| Sales YoY % | `+0.0%;-0.0%;0.0%` | Time Intelligence |  |
| Sales Prev Month | `\$#,0.00` | Time Intelligence |  |

##### Total Sales

Sum of the order line amounts.

```dax
SUM(Orders[Line Amount])
```

##### Total Cost

```dax
SUM(Orders[Line Cost])
```

##### Gross Margin

```dax
[Total Sales] - [Total Cost]
```

##### Margin %

```dax
DIVIDE([Gross Margin], [Total Sales])
```

##### Sales (Scaled)

Total Sales with a dynamic format string: $1.23M, $45.6K or $789.00.

```dax
[Total Sales]
```

##### Completed Sales

```dax
CALCULATE([Total Sales], KEEPFILTERS(Orders[Status] = "Completed"))
```

##### Shipped Sales

Sales by ship date (inactive relationship).

```dax
CALCULATE([Total Sales], USERELATIONSHIP(Orders[Ship Date], 'Date'[Date]))
```

##### Sales All Stores

```dax
CALCULATE([Total Sales], ALL(Stores))
```

##### Store Share

```dax
DIVIDE([Total Sales], [Sales All Stores])
```

##### Order Count

```dax
COUNTROWS(Orders)
```

##### Units Sold

```dax
SUM(Orders[Quantity])
```

##### Active Customers

Distinct customer ids on orders, unknown ids included.

```dax
DISTINCTCOUNTNOBLANK(Orders[Customer ID])
```

##### Avg Order Value

```dax
AVERAGEX(
    VALUES(Orders[Order ID]),
    CALCULATE(SUM(Orders[Line Amount]))
)
```

##### Revenue per Unit

```dax
DIVIDE(
    SUMX(Orders, Orders[Quantity] * Orders[Unit Price] * (1 - Orders[Discount])),
    [Units Sold]
)
```

##### Last Order Date

```dax
MAX(Orders[Order Date])
```

##### Unknown Product Orders

Orders whose product id is not in the catalog.

```dax
COUNTROWS(FILTER(Orders, ISBLANK(RELATED(Products[Product Name])))) + 0
```

##### Sales YTD

```dax
TOTALYTD([Total Sales], 'Date'[Date])
```

##### Sales PY

```dax
CALCULATE([Total Sales], SAMEPERIODLASTYEAR('Date'[Date]))
```

##### Sales YoY %

```dax
DIVIDE([Total Sales] - [Sales PY], [Sales PY])
```

##### Sales Prev Month

```dax
CALCULATE([Total Sales], DATEADD('Date'[Date], -1, MONTH))
```

#### Calculated columns

##### Line Cost

Blank when the product is not in the catalog.

```dax
Orders[Quantity] * RELATED(Products[Unit Cost])
```

##### Order Size

```dax
SWITCH(TRUE(), Orders[Line Amount] >= 1000, "Large", Orders[Line Amount] >= 250, "Medium", "Small")
```

##### Is Returned

Context transition through the one-to-one relationship to Returns.

```dax
IF(ISEMPTY(RELATEDTABLE(Returns)), "No", "Yes")
```

##### Days To Ship

```dax
IF(ISBLANK(Orders[Ship Date]), BLANK(), DATEDIFF(Orders[Order Date], Orders[Ship Date], DAY))
```

