| Converted | boolean |  | Converted |
| Is Campaign | boolean |  | Is Campaign |

#### Measures

| Measure | Format | Description |
|---|---|---|
| Sessions | `#,0` |  |
| Converted Sessions | `#,0` |  |
| Conversion Rate | `0.0%` |  |
| Avg Pages per Session | `0.0` |  |
