| Month Start | dateTime, format yyyy-mm-dd |  | [Month Start] |
| Day Type | string |  | calculated (DAX) |

#### Calculated columns

##### Day Type

```dax
IF(WEEKDAY('Date'[Date], 2) > 5, "Weekend", "Weekday")
```

#### Hierarchies

| Hierarchy | Levels | Description |
|---|---|---|
| Calendar | Year → Quarter → Month → Date |  |

#### Source

Calculated table (DAX) partition `Date`, import mode.

```dax
ADDCOLUMNS(
    CALENDAR(DATE(2024, 1, 1), DATE(2025, 12, 31)),
    "Year", YEAR([Date]),
    "Month Number", MONTH([Date]),
    "Month", FORMAT([Date], "mmm"),
    "Year Month", FORMAT([Date], "yyyy-mm"),
    "Quarter", "Q" & QUARTER([Date]),
    "Month Start", DATE(YEAR([Date]), MONTH([Date]), 1)
)
```

