### Products Never Sold

Calculated table: catalog products without any order.

Kind: calculated table.

#### Columns

| Name | Type | Description | Source |
|---|---|---|---|
| Product ID | string |  | [Product ID] |
| Product | string |  | [Product] |
| Category | string |  | [Category] |
| List Price | decimal, format \\$#,0.00 |  | [List Price] |

#### Measures

| Measure | Format | Description |
|---|---|---|
| Products Never Sold Count | `0` |  |

##### Products Never Sold Count

```dax
COUNTROWS('Products Never Sold') + 0
```

#### Source

Calculated table (DAX) partition `Products Never Sold`, import mode.

```dax
VAR SoldProducts =
    SELECTCOLUMNS(SUMMARIZE(Orders, Orders[Product ID]), "Product ID", Orders[Product ID])
VAR Catalog =
    SELECTCOLUMNS(ALL(Products), "Product ID", Products[Product ID])
VAR NeverSold = EXCEPT(Catalog, SoldProducts)
RETURN
    SELECTCOLUMNS(
        FILTER(
            ALL(Products),
            Products[Product ID] IN NeverSold
                && ISEMPTY(RELATEDTABLE(Orders))
        ),
        "Product ID", Products[Product ID],
        "Product", Products[Product Name],
        "Category", Products[Category],
        "List Price", Products[List Price]
    )
```

